4. WHAT IS NOT IN THIS REPOSITORY
---------------------------------
No customer data, no telemetry, no analytics, and no network calls to the
author. The agents run locally in your own environment against your own model
provider.

The context memory the agents use is created on your machine at install time
and never leaves it. No part of this repository transmits anything anywhere.


